      "player": "Qwen3L Rivals",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "I mulliganed to 6 cards, and now I'm selecting 1 card to put on the bottom of my library.\n\
\n\
**Current hand (7 cards):**  \n\
- Ancestral Statue  \n\
- Forest  \n\
- Ghalta, Primal Hunger  \n\
- Hedron Archive  \n\
- Lightning-Core Excavator  \n\
- Meteor Golem  \n\
- Thirst for Knowledge  \n\
\n\
I'm going to a 6-card hand, so I must bottom one card.\n\
\n\
### Analysis:\n\
- **Ghalta, Primal Hunger** {10}{G}{G} — 12/12 trample for reduced cost, but only if I have high creature power. Currently uncastable on curve and extremely slow.\n\
- **Meteor Golem** {7} — 7-mana sorcery-speed board wipe enabler. Too high for consistency.\n\
- **Ancestral Statue** {4} — 3/4 with \"return a nonland permanent\" when it enters. Moderate impact, but I have no creatures to bounce.\n\
- **Hedron Archive** {4} — Signet-style mana rock that helps fix and draw. Decent for ramping into big stuff.\n\
- **Lightning-Core Excavator** {1} — 0/3 chump blocker, sac outlet for {5}{T} to deal 3 damage.\n\
- **Thirst for Knowledge** {2}{U} — Powerful draw spell, but requires discarding two unless I discard an artifact.\n\
- **Forest** — Land. But I only have one so far.\n\
\n\
**Hand is still top-heavy**: Five of the seven cards cost 4 or more. I need to dig and fix this.\n\
\n\
### Decision:\n\
I should keep **Thirst for Knowledge** — it’s a high-impact spell that can help me find early creatures or replace this poor hand. I have two artifacts (Hedron Archive, Lightning-Core Excavator), so I can easily satisfy its discard clause.\n\
\n\
I should also keep the **Forest** — I already only have one.\n\
\n\
Among the expensive bombs:\n\
- **Ghalta** is the most expensive and least likely to be cast without setup.\n\
- **Meteor Golem** is more interactive, and **Ancestral Statue** has some flexibility.\n\
- **Hedron Archive** is excellent ramp.\n\
\n\
Best card to bottom is **Ghalta, Primal Hunger** — it’s the most uncastable and slowest card in the hand, and I don’t have the board presence to reduce it meaningfully.\n\
\n\
### Final choice: **Ghalta, Primal Hunger** to bottom.\n\
\n\
