- **Hand:** Aether Spellbomb, Ancestral Statue, Erratic Visionary, Hedron Archive, Meteor Golem, Thirst for Knowledge\n\
- **Mana available:** {G}, {U} (2 untapped lands)\n\
- **Land drop remaining:** 1\n\
\n\
