\n\
Bouncing the Beetle could be valuable — it has a +1/+1 counter ability, and opponent may use it soon.\n\
\n\
But they haven't played anything to target yet — only the Beetle.\n\
\n\
So bouncing it just delays it by one turn (they can replay).\n\
\n\
Not urgent.\n\
\n\
But having more artifacts is good.\n\
\n\
**Best play:** Cast **Aether Spellbomb**\n\
\n\
Then hold mana for interaction if needed.\n\
\n\
I’ll have 1 mana left after casting.\n\
\n\
### Chat:\n\
I already chatted last turn — not required yet.\n\
\n\
But I can comment.\n\
\n\
> \"You’re building something with that beetle? Cute. I’ve got bigger bombs.\"\n\
\n\
### Action: Cast Aether Spellbomb\n\
